silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_03_unit_and_multiplication_concrete_anchor__monadunit_vetrecord_singleleaf a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MonadUnit_VetRecord_SingleLeaf: the unit map eta: VetRecord_77 -> T_Sigma(VetRecord_77); concretely, eta maps VetRecord_77 to the single-leaf publish tree whose only node is VetRecord_77 with no publish operation applied yet; represents a raw, unapplied entry in the free monad" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_03_unit_and_multiplication_concrete_anchor__monadmul_nestedpublishflatten a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MonadMul_NestedPublishFlatten: the multiplication map mu: T_Sigma(T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)) -> T_Sigma(VetRecord_77); concretely, mu takes a nested publish tree (an outer publish tree whose leaves are inner publish trees) and flattens it by substituting each inner tree into the corresponding leaf position of the outer tree" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_03_unit_and_multiplication_concrete_anchor__nestedpublishtree_vetrecord_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "NestedPublishTree_VetRecord_77: a two-level publish tree over VetRecord_77: an outer ingest node applied to an inner tree that is itself a validate-then-render tree; mu flattens this to a three-node sequential tree ingest -> validate -> render applied to VetRecord_77" .
